---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Flu Treatment & Recovery — Medications, Home Remedies, Timeline"
  description="Evidence-based guide to treating influenza. Prescription antivirals, OTC medications, home remedies, recovery timeline, and post-flu care."
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <header class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Treatment Hub</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-navy-900 mt-2 mb-4">
        Flu Treatment & Recovery
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        From antiviral medications to home remedies — evidence-based guidance on treating influenza and recovering fully.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="/treatment/flu-medications/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💊</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Prescription Antivirals</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Tamiflu, Relenza, Xofluza — when antivirals help, how they work, and who should take them.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Learn more →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/treatment/otc-flu-medications/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💊</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">OTC Medications</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Pain relievers, decongestants, cough suppressants — what works for each flu symptom.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">View options →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/treatment/home-remedies/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🍵</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Home Remedies That Work</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Evidence-based home treatments: hydration, rest, honey, humidifiers. What science supports.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">See remedies →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/treatment/recovery-timeline/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">📅</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Recovery Timeline</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">How long recovery takes, what's normal at each stage, and when to worry about delayed recovery.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">View timeline →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/treatment/what-to-eat/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🥣</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">What to Eat With the Flu</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Foods and drinks that help recovery. What to eat (and avoid) when you have influenza.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">View guide →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/treatment/post-flu-fatigue/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">😴</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Post-Flu Fatigue & Recovery</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Why you feel exhausted after the flu. How long post-viral fatigue lasts and recovery strategies.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read more →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
